    "diagnosis": "<p>Tubular carcinoma</p>",
    "title": "",
    "legend": "<p>Core biopsy shows an invasive carcinoma with tubular features, comprising patent and angulated tubules lined by mostly single layered cuboidal cells with apical snouts, disposed within desmoplastic stroma. Accompanying changes of columnar cell hyperplasia, atypical ductal hyperplasia and low grade DCIS are present. Scattered calcifications are seen.</p>",
